<title>UK: Dresdner/JPM lead 100 mln mark Ecuador-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner/JPM lead 100 mln mark Ecuador-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following synthetic Ecuador bond has been issued by a Jersey registered special purpose vehicle, joint lead managers Dresder Bank AG and J.P. Morgan GmbH said.</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     12.25     MATURITY    02.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  =	   PAY DATE    02.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    99.00     SPREAD	+647 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JE/GE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SEVEN-YEAR BUNDS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
